<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><title>Sift — privacy</title></head>
<body><main style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 20px"><h1>privacy</h1>
<p>Your credentials live in your Mac's Keychain. Your mail lives in a local database on your Mac. Sift has no servers — nothing is sent anywhere except Google (IMAP/SMTP for mail, and Google sign-in only if you choose it).</p>
<p>Run it yourself: <code>brew install ownpath/tap/sift-bench</code> then <code>sift-bench quick</code>.</p>
